OL,3,AFlight chaos caused by 'millisecond'
OL,4,Asoftware defect, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNats chief executive Martin Rolfe told
OL,7,Fthe BBC he would not resign, saying the
OL,8,Fsoftware defect was "very, very
OL,9,Fobscure."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
