OL,3,ADonald Trump says he is banning CNN and
OL,4,APolitico from White House
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move is likely to be met with legal
OL,7,Fchallenges from the outlets involved
OL,8,Fand press freedom organisations.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
