OL,3,AAt least 21 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams Pakistan mosque
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakistan's President Asif Ali Zardari
OL,7,Fexpressed "his best wishes for the
OL,8,Fswift recovery of those injured in the
OL,9,Fexplosion" in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
